§ `s 25 -- public agencies`

`a filing requirement` MEANS AgencyCase WITH
    `the requirement is one of retention or of an original` IS FALSE
    `the section 9 or 10 conditions are met` IS FALSE

`a retention requirement met under section 9` MEANS AgencyCase WITH
    `the requirement is one of retention or of an original` IS TRUE
    `the section 9 or 10 conditions are met` IS TRUE

`a retention requirement not met` MEANS AgencyCase WITH
    `the requirement is one of retention or of an original` IS TRUE
    `the section 9 or 10 conditions are met` IS FALSE

`a filing requirement with conditions met` MEANS AgencyCase WITH
    `the requirement is one of retention or of an original` IS FALSE
    `the section 9 or 10 conditions are met` IS TRUE

