§ `Offences -- maxima`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `failing to comply with a direction to an electronic transferable records provider` EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `failing to comply with a direction to an electronic transferable records provider` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `failing to comply with a direction to a designated person` EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `failing to comply with a direction to a designated person` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `disclosing information obtained under the Act` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `disclosing information obtained under the Act` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `obstructing computer access or failing to give technical assistance` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `obstructing computer access or failing to give technical assistance` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `obstructing or assaulting the Controller` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `obstructing or assaulting the Controller` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `publishing a certificate for a fraudulent purpose` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `publishing a certificate for a fraudulent purpose` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `misrepresenting identity to a certification authority` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `misrepresenting identity to a certification authority` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment` `obstructing or assaulting the Controller` LESS THAN `the maximum imprisonment` `obstructing computer access or failing to give technical assistance`

